From 242af72ecf5eb6b810306362547ca0ed6505fe9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 23:33:47 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09489/11362] Act on the adversarial review of the
 induce-budget fix

Findings from the hostile review of 512eca0e6b, each addressed:

* BLOCKER: the freshness rebuilds regenerated provenance wholesale and
  DROPPED 26 hand-written freshness_acknowledgements (25 on the
  early-stop sweep, 1 on max-actions) -- a never-prune violation
  executed by the rebuild tooling. Restored verbatim; recorded on the
  rebuild note. Both artifacts were then rebuilt once more in place
  against the final harness bytes and leaf-diffed: 0 measurement
  values changed either time.

* Launch-wait coupling: load_wait_attempts derived from the request
  timeout, so the 600->2400 floor raise would have turned a
  crash-at-startup server into a silent 40-minute stall. Capped at
  300 attempts (10 min), byte-preserving the old ceiling.

* _default_induce_timeout_s: malformed CARNOT_ARC_INDUCE_TIMEOUT now
  falls back to the derived default instead of crashing at dataclass
  construction.

* Pool clamp floor: under 1024 tokens of room passes through
  unclamped -- a few-token "successful" completion is mode C; the
  loud admission refusal is better.

* Old-label consumers widened additively (experiment_5727 classifier,
  arc_action_provenance_census SKIP_NO_ENGINE). experiment_5727 also
  picked up its first ruff-format pass (format-non-clean at HEAD; the
  hook refuses staged unformatted files), so a cosmetic reflow of
  four dict literals rides along.

* _model_specs label refresh after round 1 of the refinement loop:
  the entry-time /props read can name a wrong-model squatter that
  _ensure_server then refuses and replaces during the first call.

* Harness docstring no longer overclaims full _proposer() parity.

Spec: amendments appended to REQ-ARC-WMTE-6610/6620/6630 (clamp floor
+ SCENARIO-6620-4, launch-wait decoupling, label refresh, env-parse
hardening, consumer widening). ops/changelog.md entry added; the
matching ops/status.md entry already landed in 69caf57701 via a
concurrent agent's sweep of this working tree.

Accepted risks recorded: concurrent local inductions sharing one
pool; exact-string source pins in the clamp wiring test.

Pre-existing failures reproduced on clean HEAD, unrelated:
test_experiment_4664 degenerate-goal; test_experiment_5727
port-override (asserts the retired gemma-4-31B-it-qat pin).

